  "body": "```html\r\n<form id=\"form\">\r\n  <input name=\"foo\">\r\n  <input name=\"sb\" type=\"submit\">\r\n</form>\r\n```\r\n\r\nCurrently, it's possible to disable the submit button with `form.sb = true` to disable this form submission (either by clicking the submit button, or pressing enter in a field)\r\n\r\nI'd like to propose that `form.disabled = true` behaves similarly, currently it does nothing to prevent submission\r\n",
